[ LOWER CHARS 'TW' BIND TW 0 GET UPPER TW 1 DROP JOIN 2 COLLECT JOIN ] 'E1B.CAP' DEF
[ 'CX' BIND CX 2 DIV CX 3 MUL 1 ADD CX CX 2 DIV FLOOR 2 MUL SUB 0 EQ SELECT 'CY' BIND 1 CY CX 1 EQ SELECT ] 'E1B.CSTEP' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS [ 'ORD' BIND 0 ORD 'qty' GET ORD 'price' GET MUL ORD 'price' GET NIL? SELECT ] MAP 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] 'E1B.REVENUE' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS 'OL' BIND OL [ 'sku' GET ] MAP OL [ 'qty' GET ] MAP GROUP 'QG' BIND QG KEYS QG VALUES [ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] MAP RECORD ] 'E1B.QTYSKU' DEF
'(((((()))))'
CHARS '#' [ G0A.BSTEP ] FOLD '#' EQ
